<tr><td>Zion Williamson</td><td>45"</td><td>~8'7"</td><td>~12'4"</td><td>~28"</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>The table tells the whole story. Zion Williamson and AJ Dybantsa — two of the most explosively gifted athletes ever tested at the NBA combine — peak at approximately 12'4". Wembanyama, with his "below average" 32-inch vertical, peaks at approximately 12'8". <strong>His ceiling is higher than Zion's despite jumping 13 inches less.</strong></p>
